sequenceDiagram

actor Caller as Customer, provider representative or administrator
participant Server as server.js
participant Route as Matching router + guards + validation
participant C as Named feature controller
participant M as Provider / ProviderApplication / Vehicle / Booking
participant DB as MongoDB
Caller->>Server: GET private list or detail
Server->>Route: Registered resource path
Route->>Route: Authenticate and authorize, approval for provider vehicles/bookings
Route->>Route: Validate ID, filters and pagination, reject body
Route->>C: req.actor + req.validated
activate C
C->>C: Build ownership-scoped filter before loading records
Note over C,M: Customer booking scope = actor.userId, provider scope = actor.providerId, admin scope may be global
C->>M: Find/count scoped records with selected filters
M->>DB: Execute reads and list ordering/pagination
DB-->>M: Records and total, or no detail
M-->>C: Scoped results
opt Booking response
    C->>M: Populate only current customer name, email, telephone
    M->>DB: Read selected current contact
    C->>C: Derive status using Thailand today, retain stored snapshot
end
C->>C: Serialize safe fields, missing/hidden detail becomes 404
C-->>Server: 200 data, count and pagination for lists
deactivate C
Server-->>Caller: JSON response
